   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D001-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D001",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "事務室の前で待っていました。",
   "start_sec": 3.831,
   "end_sec": 5.706,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D001-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D001",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "今日は初めてですね。",
   "start_sec": 5.856,
   "end_sec": 7.505,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D001-S05",
   "unit_id": "C27-D001",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "まず、ルールを確認しましょう。",
   "start_sec": 7.655,
   "end_sec": 9.523,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D002-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "おはようございます。",
   "start_sec": 9.873,
   "end_sec": 11.298,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D002-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "13時から仕事があるので、12時20分に出なければならないんです。",
   "start_sec": 11.448,
   "end_sec": 16.57,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D002-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "清掃も必要ですよね。",
   "start_sec": 16.72,
   "end_sec": 18.789,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D003-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "清掃は12時半からですが、先に帰る人はしなくてもいいです。",
   "start_sec": 19.139,
   "end_sec": 23.897,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D003-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "今は9時40分ですね。",
   "start_sec": 24.047,
   "end_sec": 26.102,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D003-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "9時45分から準備を手伝ってください。",
   "start_sec": 26.252,
   "end_sec": 29.204,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D004-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 29.554,
   "end_sec": 30.211,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D004-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "野菜を洗います。",
   "start_sec": 30.361,
   "end_sec": 31.827,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D004-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "ここは学校の給食のキッチンですか。",
   "start_sec": 31.977,
   "end_sec": 34.939,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D004-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "入口に子ども専用の椅子もありますね。",
   "start_sec": 35.089,
   "end_sec": 37.918,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D005-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "いいえ、地域の料理の会で使っています。",
   "start_sec": 38.268,
   "end_sec": 41.366,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D005-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "あの椅子は子どもの会で使います。",
   "start_sec": 41.516,
   "end_sec": 43.838,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D005-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "では、受付で鍵を借りましょう。",
   "start_sec": 43.988,
   "end_sec": 46.411,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D006-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "おはようございます。",
   "start_sec": 46.761,
   "end_sec": 48.361,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D006-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "今日は10時から13時まで、600円です。",
   "start_sec": 48.511,
   "end_sec": 51.676,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D006-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "準備は9時45分からで構いません。",
   "start_sec": 51.826,
   "end_sec": 54.891,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D007-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "はい、600円です。",
   "start_sec": 55.241,
   "end_sec": 57.102,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D007-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "今日の会費は無しですね。",
   "start_sec": 57.252,
   "end_sec": 59.085,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D007-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "材料はめいめい持ってきました。",
   "start_sec": 59.235,
   "end_sec": 61.257,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D008-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 61.607,
   "end_sec": 62.783,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D008-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "追加の支払いは不要です。",
   "start_sec": 62.933,
   "end_sec": 64.972,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D008-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "人数は16人までです。",
   "start_sec": 65.122,
   "end_sec": 68.029,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D008-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "今日は何人ですか。",
   "start_sec": 68.179,
   "end_sec": 70.116,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D009-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D009",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "12人です。",
   "start_sec": 70.466,
   "end_sec": 71.516,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D009-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D009",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "13時から次の教室ですね。",
   "start_sec": 71.666,
   "end_sec": 74.043,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D009-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D009",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "私は最後に鍵を返します。",
   "start_sec": 74.193,
   "end_sec": 76.396,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D009-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D009",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "ミラさんは戻らなくても大丈夫ですよ。",
   "start_sec": 76.546,
   "end_sec": 78.85,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D010-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D010",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "ありがとうございます。",
   "start_sec": 79.2,
   "end_sec": 80.599,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D010-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D010",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "掲示の21時は最後の期限で、今日は13時前ですね。",
   "start_sec": 80.749,
   "end_sec": 85.772,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D010-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D010",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "ちゃんと覚えました。",
   "start_sec": 85.922,
   "end_sec": 87.117,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D011-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "ええ。",
   "start_sec": 87.467,
   "end_sec": 88.578,
   "review_flags": [
    "low_ASR_text_match",
    "clip_asr_difference"
   ],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D011-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "遅れては困ります。",
   "start_sec": 88.728,
   "end_sec": 90.496,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D011-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "次の人が入れませんから。",
   "start_sec": 90.646,
   "end_sec": 92.85,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D011-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "それから、入口の立札は隣の会議室の注意です。",
   "start_sec": 93.0,
   "end_sec": 98.035,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D011-S05",
   "unit_id": "C27-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "事務室への出入りは管理人に相談してください。",
   "start_sec": 98.185,
   "end_sec": 101.367,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D012-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "「土足で入るべからず」ですか。",
   "start_sec": 101.717,
   "end_sec": 104.437,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D012-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "「靴を脱いでください」という意味ですね。",
   "start_sec": 104.587,
   "end_sec": 107.341,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D012-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "キッチンでも脱ぎますか。",
   "start_sec": 107.491,
   "end_sec": 109.467,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D013-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "キッチンでは脱がなくてもいいです。",
   "start_sec": 109.817,
   "end_sec": 111.978,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D013-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "ただし、たばこはどちらでも吸ってはいけません。",
   "start_sec": 112.128,
   "end_sec": 114.928,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D013-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "石井",
   "text": "マッチも使わないでください。",
   "start_sec": 115.078,
   "end_sec": 116.798,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D014-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "では、準備を始めましょう。",
   "start_sec": 117.148,
   "end_sec": 119.171,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D014-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "机を動かす前に、下の埃を掃きます。",
   "start_sec": 119.321,
   "end_sec": 122.765,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D014-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "ミラさん、この箱を見てください。",
   "start_sec": 122.915,
   "end_sec": 125.254,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D014-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "新しい箱を設置しましたから、物を床に置かなくてもいいです。",
   "start_sec": 125.404,
   "end_sec": 129.579,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D015-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "落し物の箱ですね。",
   "start_sec": 129.929,
   "end_sec": 131.933,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D015-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "誰かの乾電池があります。",
   "start_sec": 132.083,
   "end_sec": 133.987,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D015-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "でも、ごみですか。",
   "start_sec": 134.137,
   "end_sec": 135.721,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D015-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "勝手に捨てるのはいけませんね。",
   "start_sec": 135.871,
   "end_sec": 137.773,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D016-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "そうですね。",
   "start_sec": 138.123,
   "end_sec": 139.156,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D016-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "管理人に聞きましょう。",
   "start_sec": 139.306,
   "end_sec": 140.915,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D016-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "今日は大掃除ではありませんから、私たちの机の下だけでいいです。",
   "start_sec": 141.065,
   "end_sec": 145.593,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D017-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "料理の後のごみはどうしますか。",
   "start_sec": 145.943,
   "end_sec": 148.261,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D017-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "ビニールの袋に全部入れてもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 148.411,
   "end_sec": 151.263,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D017-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "紙とプラスチックは別ですか。",
   "start_sec": 151.413,
   "end_sec": 153.536,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D018-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "別です。",
   "start_sec": 153.886,
   "end_sec": 154.73,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D018-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "包み紙はこちら、生ゴミはあちらです。",
   "start_sec": 154.88,
   "end_sec": 157.859,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D018-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "生ゴミは私が持ち帰ります。",
   "start_sec": 158.009,
   "end_sec": 160.225,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D018-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "空き缶は洗って、受付の横の箱に入れてください。",
   "start_sec": 160.375,
   "end_sec": 163.769,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D019-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "承知しました。",
   "start_sec": 164.119,
   "end_sec": 165.652,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D019-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "外のプラカードにも「ごみを散らかさないで」とありますね。",
   "start_sec": 165.802,
   "end_sec": 170.011,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D019-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "人が手に持って、歩行者に見せています。",
   "start_sec": 170.161,
   "end_sec": 172.775,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D020-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "広場でも今日は清掃の日なんです。",
   "start_sec": 173.125,
   "end_sec": 176.088,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D020-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "前に子どもがごみでいたずらをして、大人が「こらっ、ふざけるな」と言いました。",
   "start_sec": 176.238,
   "end_sec": 181.895,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D021-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "強い言い方ですね。",
   "start_sec": 182.245,
   "end_sec": 184.257,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D021-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "友達には「騒がないでください」でいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 184.407,
   "end_sec": 187.541,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D021-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "大声で注意するのも困りますね。",
   "start_sec": 187.691,
   "end_sec": 190.132,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D022-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "ええ。",
   "start_sec": 190.482,
   "end_sec": 190.954,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D022-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "規律は大切ですが、理由も説明しましょう。",
   "start_sec": 191.104,
   "end_sec": 194.626,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D022-S03",
   "unit_id": "C27-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "秩序を守るのは、一人の仕事ではありません。",
   "start_sec": 194.776,
   "end_sec": 197.751,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D022-S04",
   "unit_id": "C27-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "村田",
   "text": "私も絶対に時間を守ります。",
   "start_sec": 197.901,
   "end_sec": 200.068,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D023-S01",
   "unit_id": "C27-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "私は12時20分に電気を消しますか。",
   "start_sec": 200.418,
   "end_sec": 204.293,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C27-D023-S02",
   "unit_id": "C27-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミラ",
   "text": "それとも、まだ料理をしていますか。",
   "start_sec": 204.443,
   "end_sec": 207.071,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
